Package: shinymodist
Title: Interactive Distribution Inputs for Shiny
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joshua", "Kunst", email = "jbkunst@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("William", "Dean", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Author of the bundled modist JavaScript library")
    )
Description: Provides compact Shiny inputs for interactively shaping probability
    distributions. Wraps the JavaScript widgets from 'modist' and exposes their
    canonical distribution parameters as regular Shiny input values.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://jbkunst.github.io/shinymodist/, https://github.com/jbkunst/shinymodist
BugReports: https://github.com/jbkunst/shinymodist/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
